# .docket — how this project is to be treated

**numbering: numbers**

This project adopted the Docket fresh, at framework 4.2.0 on 2026-09-22, so its
codes number the leaf: `M`, `MA`, `MA1`, `MA2`.

The updater stamped this file `numbering: letters` on install, on the
assumption that any project it runs against predates numbered leaves. That
assumption is false for a fresh install made by the documented route (run the
updater at install step 3), and it silently stops `check_codes.py` recognising
`MA1` as a code at all. Corrected by hand and reported to the master Docket.

Do not re-index. Codes are permanent.
